      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ</unicode>
      <uighur>tus</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тус</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TUS</transcript>
      <definition>1 a) adj. Before-mentioned, specified or said; the given; this very, this same. b) adj. Separate, individual, each, every, personal, one's own. c) adv. Opposite, face to face, in front of.</definition>
      <page>844</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠭᠠᠵᠠᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- γazar</transcript>
          <definition> This very place, this same place.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠺᠡᠷᠡᠭᠬ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kereg</transcript>
          <definition> The said matter, the matter in question, this very matter.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠪᠦᠷᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- byri</transcript>
          <definition> See tusburi.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠪᠦᠷᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠡᠭᠦᠷᠭᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- byri jin egyrge</transcript>
          <definition> The particular duty of each individual.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠰᠠᠪᠢᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- sakixu</transcript>
          <definition> To attend to or mind one's own affairs.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠲᠣᠰ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tus</transcript>
          <definition> Correspondingly, respectively; each individually, everyone.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠲᠣᠰ ᠢᠶᠠᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tus ijer</transcript>
          <definition> Each one separately.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠲᠣᠰ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tus tur</transcript>
          <definition> To each one.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠲᠣᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠭᠡᠷ ᠎ᠲᠡᠭᠡᠨ ᠪᠤᠴᠠᠯᠤᠭ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tus un ger tegen bucaluγ-a</transcript>
          <definition> Each returned to his own house.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠺᠡᠷᠡᠭ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- un kereg</transcript>
          <definition> Personal affair, one's own affair</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠪᠣᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bolxu</transcript>
          <definition> To be near; to be present; to face, appear in front of, happen to be present or near.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠰ ᠡᠮᠦᠨᠡ ᠪᠡᠨ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- emyne ben xaraxu</transcript>
          <definition> To look straight ahead.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠭᠦᠳᠡᠨ ᠲᠣᠰ</unicode>
          <transcript>egyden -- </transcript>
          <definition> In front of the door.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
